PRO FORMA FIRST BOARD RESOLUTION
WHEREAS the Corporation is to be incorporated under the Business Corporations Act of Quebec;
RESOLVED that the initial share subscription be approved: 100 common shares with par value of $1 each, all subscribed by the incorporator;
RESOLVED that the registered office of the Corporation be established at [full Quebec address];
RESOLVED that [Name] be appointed President, [Name] Secretary, and [Name] Treasurer;
RESOLVED that the initial by-laws be adopted as presented and directors authorized to execute documents and conduct affairs. Passed unanimously on [Date]. (92 words)
